      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One tap sets all the mechanism values below. Try the next one if the bike does not come back unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eén tik stelt alle mechanismewaarden hieronder in. Probeer de volgende als de fiets niet ontgrendeld terugkomt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only watches the bike and keeps the log. Use the buttons to lock and unlock by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Houdt de fiets alleen in de gaten en houdt het logboek bij. Gebruik de knoppen om met de hand te vergrendelen en ontgrendelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Out of range": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buiten bereik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair your bike": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Koppel je fiets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair your phone with the bike in the official Cowboy app once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Koppel je telefoon één keer met de fiets in de officiële Cowboy-app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your bike below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies hieronder je fiets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your bike from the list on the home screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies je fiets uit de lijst op het beginscherm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please attach the log from the Log card's share button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voeg het logboek toe via de deelknop op de Logboek-kaart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poll lock state during a ride": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slotstatus uitlezen tijdens een rit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presets": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voorinstellingen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problems": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problemen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purchase": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aankoop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "READING…": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UITLEZEN…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Re-unlocks the bike when it locks itself while you are riding, for example after a battery hiccup. Locking it on purpose, or the bike's own auto-lock when parked, is left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ontgrendelt de fiets weer als hij zichzelf vergrendelt terwijl je rijdt, bijvoorbeeld na een accustoring. Bewust vergrendelen, of de automatische vergrendeling van de fiets zelf als hij geparkeerd staat, blijft ongemoeid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reconnect window": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Herverbindingsvenster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Purchases": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Herstel aankopen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
