    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Systeem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The App Store did not return this product. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De App Store gaf dit product niet terug. Controleer je verbinding en probeer het opnieuw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Live Activity shows lock state, battery and the last event on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island while a ride is active. It is updated on bike events only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De Live Activity toont de slotstatus, de accu en de laatste gebeurtenis op het toegangsscherm en in het Dynamic Island zolang er een rit actief is. Hij wordt alleen bijgewerkt bij gebeurtenissen van de fiets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trial lasts 7 days. After it ends, automatic re-unlock stops; the manual buttons and the log keep working. Keep it forever for %@ (one-time purchase, no subscription).": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De proefperiode duurt 7 dagen. Daarna stopt het automatisch ontgrendelen; de knoppen en het logboek blijven werken. Houd het voor altijd voor %@ (eenmalige aankoop, geen abonnement)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial ended": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proefperiode afgelopen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial ended, automatic unlock is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proefperiode afgelopen, automatisch ontgrendelen staat uit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial ends %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proefperiode eindigt %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial until %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proefperiode tot %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Lasso free for 7 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probeer Lasso 7 dagen gratis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try automatic re-unlock free for 7 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probeer automatisch ontgrendelen 7 dagen gratis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try with a demo bike": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probeer met een demofiets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UNLOCKED": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ONTGRENDELD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo any lock during a ride": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke vergrendeling tijdens een rit terugdraaien"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ontgrendel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock write with response": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ontgrendeling schrijven met antwoord"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ontgrendeld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocks the bike every time your phone connects to it, no matter how it got locked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ontgrendelt de fiets elke keer dat je telefoon verbinding maakt, hoe hij ook vergrendeld is geraakt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Versie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the bike": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wachten op de fiets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a Cowboy's battery cuts out mid-ride, the bike locks itself. Lasso notices within a second and unlocks it again, so you can keep riding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als de accu van een Cowboy tijdens het rijden uitvalt, vergrendelt de fiets zichzelf. Lasso merkt dat binnen een seconde en ontgrendelt hem opnieuw, zodat je door kunt rijden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the bike is re-unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als de fiets weer ontgrendeld is"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write with response, 1 s after reconnect, 3 retries every 2 s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schrijven met antwoord, 1 s na herverbinden, 3 pogingen elke 2 s."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write without response like the nRF fob, 0.5 s delay, 5 retries every 1 s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schrijven zonder antwoord zoals de nRF-sleutelhanger, 0,5 s vertraging, 5 pogingen elke 1 s."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You own Lasso. Thank you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lasso is van jou. Bedankt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Lasso trial has ended": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je Lasso-proefperiode is afgelopen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
